    "title": "Safe and Sane Fireworks Sales Start in North County as Officials Warn of Illegal Use - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Janene Scully, Noozhawk North County Editor ,\n1 days ago Sales of safe and sane fireworks are underway in three North County cities, prompting reminders about the rules and pleas about when to report incidents. Nonprofit groups in Lompoc, Santa Maria and Guadalupe can sell safe and safe fireworks through the Fourth of July. However, those fireworks can be used only in those cities during specified hours on the holiday, which is Saturday. Read full article",
